# Shell scripts run under bash and inside Linux containers, where a CRLF
# checkout (Git for Windows' default) breaks the shebang line: the API image
# would fail to start with "no such file or directory". PowerShell scripts are
# the Windows side and are kept CRLF so Windows PowerShell 5.1 reads them cleanly.
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.ps1  text eol=crlf
